1 of 11 for the stock personae, 7 of 11 with four layers, 5 of 11 with all five, which is the default.
The 'In range' column is the default arm. It allows the 10% padding `signatures.in_real_range`
applies, and it is the weaker of the two tests this package runs: `examples/configuration_arbiter.py`
asks whether a day of this looks like a day of real data, and prefers the five-layer arm.
    stock 2008: completed 9/10, time below 70 0.0-0.8%
   +physiology: completed 8/10, time below 70 0.1-4.7%
    +behaviour: completed 7/10, time below 70 0.0-2.0%
         +loop: completed 9/10, time below 70 0.6-2.6%
       +sensor: completed 10/10, time below 70 0.5-3.3%
         +site: completed 7/10, time below 70 0.1-3.1%
